invariant: INV-16
file: chacha20_vector.h
catches: test/chacha-builds.sh
reason: chacha20_vector.h no longer stops a build whose compiler targets
  neither NEON nor SSE2. chacha20_vector.c would then fail later on a
  missing intrinsic header, or on a toolchain that ships one, compile a
  path nothing here has tested. The script compiles the header for the
  Cortex-M3 with the pinned clang and requires the refusal.

--- old
#if !defined(__ARM_NEON) && !defined(__SSE2__)
--- new
#if 0
